OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry start with some
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells. Widespread
OL,7,Fsunshine for a time, but turning
OL,8,Fhazier from the west through the
OL,9,Fafternoon with rain reaching Hampshire
OL,10,Fand other southern counties by early
OL,11,Fevening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain quickly spreading
OL,14,Fnortheastwards this evening and
OL,15,Fbecoming persistent overnight. The
OL,16,Frain will be heavy at times and
OL,17,Faccompanied by a strengthening breeze,
OL,18,Fparticularly along the south coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
